# Generated map data is committed IN FULL (world base, manifest, guess pool, the
# puzzle index, and every per-puzzle diff) so the deployed site has the data
# physically present — the Vercel/Netlify build can't run the Python/GEOS
# pipeline, and a 30–40 min generation step is too slow for a deploy step.
# `npm run sync-data` refreshes public/data/ from ../out/ after regenerating.
# Every puzzle defaults to its organic seam variant and also ships the straight
# seam variant as a dev-mode reference; 45 puzzles additionally ship a distorted
# variant (the entries carrying diffDistorted in puzzles.json).
